{"seq":3,"slug":"trigonometric-functions","title":"高一数学 — 三角函数","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/functions/trigonometric-functions","wordCount":1440,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一数学-三角函数\">高一数学 — 三角函数</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>三角函数是以角度为自变量、以比值为函数值的一类函数，是高中数学的核心内容之一。三角函数将几何中的角度关系转化为代数运算，在物理学、工程学和信号处理中有广泛应用。高一阶段需要掌握：任意角与弧度制、三角函数的定义、基本三角函数（正弦、余弦、正切）的图像与性质、三角恒等变换的基本公式。</p>\n<p>前置知识：初中阶段的锐角三角函数（直角三角形中的正弦、余弦、正切定义）、角的度量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-任意角与弧度制\">一、任意角与弧度制</h3><p><strong>任意角的概念</strong>：将角的概念从锐角推广到任意角。按旋转方向规定：逆时针旋转为正角，顺时针旋转为负角，不旋转为零角。角可以大于360°（旋转超过一周），也可以为负值。</p>\n<p><strong>终边相同的角</strong>：与角α终边相同的所有角可以表示为α + k·360°（k∈ℤ），或用弧度制表示为α + 2kπ（k∈ℤ）。</p>\n<p><strong>弧度制</strong>：用弧长与半径的比值来度量角的大小。1弧度 = 180°/π ≈ 57.3°。</p>\n<p>角度与弧度的换算：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>度数</th>\n<th>0°</th>\n<th>30°</th>\n<th>45°</th>\n<th>60°</th>\n<th>90°</th>\n<th>180°</th>\n<th>270°</th>\n<th>360°</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>弧度</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>π/6</td>\n<td>π/4</td>\n<td>π/3</td>\n<td>π/2</td>\n<td>π</td>\n<td>3π/2</td>\n<td>2π</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>换算公式：弧度数 = 度数 × π/180，度数 = 弧度数 × 180/π。</p>\n<p>弧长公式：l = |α| · r，扇形面积：S = (1/2)|α|<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = (1/2)lr。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-三角函数的定义\">二、三角函数的定义</h3><p>设角α的终边与单位圆（圆心在原点、半径为1的圆）的交点为P(x, y)，则：</p>\n<p>sin α = y（P点的纵坐标）</p>\n<p>cos α = x（P点的横坐标）</p>\n<p>tan α = y/x（x ≠ 0）</p>\n<p>这一定义将三角函数从直角三角形推广到了任意角。</p>\n<p><strong>各象限三角函数的符号</strong>（口诀：&quot;一全正，二正弦，三正切，四余弦&quot;）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>象限</th>\n<th>sin α</th>\n<th>cos α</th>\n<th>tan α</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一象限</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二象限</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三象限</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第四象限</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-正弦函数y-sin-x\">三、正弦函数y = sin x</h3><p><strong>图像特征</strong>：正弦曲线是一条连续的波浪形曲线，在y = -1和y = 1之间振荡。</p>\n<p><strong>基本性质</strong>：</p>\n<p>定义域：ℝ</p>\n<p>值域：[-1, 1]</p>\n<p>周期：2π（最小正周期）</p>\n<p>奇偶性：奇函数，sin(-x) = -sin x</p>\n<p>单调性：在[-π/2 + 2kπ, π/2 + 2kπ]上递增，在[π/2 + 2kπ, 3π/2 + 2kπ]上递减</p>\n<p>最大值：sin x = 1 当x = π/2 + 2kπ</p>\n<p>最小值：sin x = -1 当x = -π/2 + 2kπ</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-余弦函数y-cos-x\">四、余弦函数y = cos x</h3><p><strong>基本性质</strong>：</p>\n<p>定义域：ℝ</p>\n<p>值域：[-1, 1]</p>\n<p>周期：2π</p>\n<p>奇偶性：偶函数，cos(-x) = cos x</p>\n<p>单调性：在[2kπ - π, 2kπ]上递增，在[2kπ, 2kπ + π]上递减</p>\n<p>关键关系：cos x = sin(x + π/2)，即余弦函数可以看作正弦函数向左平移π/2个单位。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-基本三角恒等式\">五、基本三角恒等式</h3><p><strong>同角三角函数的基本关系</strong>：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sin^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>α + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cos^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>α = 1（勾股关系）</p>\n<p>tan α = sin α / cos α（商数关系）</p>\n<p><strong>诱导公式</strong>（核心规律：&quot;奇变偶不变，符号看象限&quot;）：</p>\n<p>π/2相关的公式（奇变）：</p>\n<p>sin(π/2 - α) = cos α，cos(π/2 - α) = sin α</p>\n<p>sin(π/2 + α) = cos α，cos(π/2 + α) = -sin α</p>\n<p>π相关的公式（偶不变）：</p>\n<p>sin(π - α) = sin α，cos(π - α) = -cos α</p>\n<p>sin(π + α) = -sin α，cos(π + α) = -cos α</p>\n<p><strong>和差角公式</strong>：</p>\n<p>sin(α ± β) = sin α cos β ± cos α sin β</p>\n<p>cos(α ± β) = cos α cos β ∓ sin α sin β</p>\n<p><strong>二倍角公式</strong>：</p>\n<p>sin 2α = 2 sin α cos α</p>\n<p>cos 2α = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cos^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>α - <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sin^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>α = 2<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cos^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>α - 1 = 1 - 2<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sin^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>α</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-函数y-a-sin-x\">六、函数y = A sin(ωx + φ)</h3><p><strong>参数含义</strong>：</p>\n<p>A——振幅，|A|决定函数值的最大变化范围</p>\n<p>ω——角频率，周期T = 2π/|ω|</p>\n<p>φ——初相，决定图像的水平平移</p>\n<p><strong>图像变换</strong>：从y = sin x到y = A sin(ωx + φ)可分三步：先平移（φ的作用），再伸缩x轴（ω的作用），最后伸缩y轴（A的作用）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>将下列角度转化为弧度：(1) 150°; (2) -225°; (3) 330°。将下列弧度转化为角度：(1) 5π/6; (2) -3π/4。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>已知sin α = 3/5，α在第二象限，求cos α和tan α的值。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>化简：sin(π + α) · cos(2π - α) · tan(-α) / [sin(-α) · cos(π + α)]。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>求函数y = 2sin(2x + π/3)的振幅、周期和初相，并画出其在一个周期内的图像。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>三角函数起源于古代天文学对天体运行的描述，古希腊天文学家希帕克斯编制了最早的三角函数表。傅里叶发现任何周期函数都可以分解为正弦和余弦函数的叠加（傅里叶级数），这一发现是信号处理和通信技术的数学基础。推荐阅读《三角之美》了解三角函数在自然界和工程中的奇妙应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"function-concept\">函数概念与性质</a> —— 三角函数是最重要的周期函数，其奇偶性（sin 奇、cos 偶）、单调区间、值域分析都建立在函数基本性质的框架之上。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../sequences/sequence-applications\">数列应用</a> —— 三角函数的傅里叶级数把周期函数分解为正弦余弦的叠加，与数列求和的思想相通，可对照理解。</li>\n<li>跨学科（物理·圆周运动）：<a href=\"../../physics/dynamics/circular-motion\">圆周运动</a> 与 <a href=\"../../physics/kinematics/projectile-motion\">平抛运动</a> —— 圆周运动的位置随时间按正弦余弦变化，物理中的角速度、相位与三角函数的 ω、φ 一一对应，是三角函数最核心的物理背景。</li>\n<li>跨学科（数学与统计·线性代数）：<a href=\"../../../../../mathematics-statistics/linear-algebra/linear-transformations/transformation-basics\">线性变换基础</a> —— 平面旋转变换由正弦余弦构成的旋转矩阵描述，三角恒等式（和差角公式）正对应旋转矩阵的乘法。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>三角函数通过弧度制和单位圆定义将角度关系代数化，使得几何问题可以用代数方法处理。正弦函数和余弦函数是最基本的周期函数，它们的图像、性质和变换规律是三角函数学习的核心。三角恒等变换（诱导公式、和差角公式、二倍角公式）则为三角函数的化简、求值和证明提供了强大的工具。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一数学 — 三角函数","id":"高一数学-三角函数"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、任意角与弧度制","id":"一-任意角与弧度制"},{"level":3,"text":"二、三角函数的定义","id":"二-三角函数的定义"},{"level":3,"text":"三、正弦函数y = sin x","id":"三-正弦函数y-sin-x"},{"level":3,"text":"四、余弦函数y = cos x","id":"四-余弦函数y-cos-x"},{"level":3,"text":"五、基本三角恒等式","id":"五-基本三角恒等式"},{"level":3,"text":"六、函数y = A sin(ωx + φ)","id":"六-函数y-a-sin-x"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高一数学 — 指数与对数函数","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/functions/exponential-log"},"next":{"title":"高一数学 — 等差数列","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sequences/arithmetic-sequence"}}